# Mobile (`apps/mobile`)

## Folder rules

- `app/` — Expo Router screens only (compose UI + hooks).
- `src/features/<domain>/` — feature UI, feature hooks, feature API.
- `src/hooks/` — cross-feature hooks only.
- `src/types/` — mobile-only types; prefer `@fleetflow/shared-types`.
- `src/constants/` — intervals, storage keys, route names, map defaults.
- `src/services/` — axios client, WebSocketManager, location, secure storage.
- `src/store/` — Redux Toolkit slices only.

## Patterns

```tsx
// ✅ screen is thin
export default function DeliveryScreen() {
  const { delivery, start } = useDeliveryDetails(id);
  return <DeliveryDetailsView delivery={delivery} onStart={start} />;
}
```

- Tracking state (`isTracking`, `pendingLocations`, `connectionStatus`) lives in Redux `tracking` slice.
- Lists/details from API: TanStack Query; mutate via services, invalidate queries.
- Tokens only in SecureStore; Axios interceptor refreshes on 401 once, then logout.
- Maps: markers + polyline + camera helpers in `features/map`, not in the screen file.
- Background GPS needs a dev build — gate behind feature flag / clear comments; do not assume Expo Go.
